WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t2-09-pursue-withdraw.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:05.910
One of you instinctively moves toward the conflict to fix it.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:09.120
While the other moves away to find safety.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.730
And from inside your own skin,

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:15.460
Your move feels like the only same response

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.210
To what the other is doing.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.590
This practice will not take sides

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.140
Or point fingers

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:40.140
Because seeking who started the loop is the very dynamic that keeps you
trapped in it.

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:58.240
The body reacts instantly with an automatic nervous system in post.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.090
While the reflective mind tries to make sense of the panic.

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:06.600
Creating a profound gap between reaction and wisdom.

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:09.960
Let us step through four stages to break the cycle.

phase-recognise
00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.920
First we recognise where this dynamic settles

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.360
In your physical body right now.

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.640
If your tendency is to pursue,

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.420
You likely feel a high fast tightness in your chest.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.280
And an urgent restlessness in your hands.

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:38.850
If your tendency is to withdraw,

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:41.260
You likely feel a sudden numbness

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:43.710
A flat sensation in the stomach.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:03.460
Both reactions are the exact same survival system operating in opposite
directions.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:06.290
Name your physical state in one word

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:09.090
Such as reactive or frozen

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.820
Notice what that simple word drops.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.720
It drops their actions

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.110
Their tone

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:18.220
And your detailed critique of their behavior.

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:40.750
Step 1 layer deeper to realize that both of you are running from the exact
same underlying fear of disconnection.

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:43.380
Just using inverse strategies.

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:45.810
Leave that realization.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.770
Right where it is without trying to fix them.

phase-regulate
00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:54.150
Second, we regulate your body so you are no longer driven by impulse.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.930
Inhale steadily for six counts

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:59.320
Feeling the ribcage widen?

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.070
An exhale smoothly for six counts.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:06.230
Bring your full awareness to the center of your chest.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:08.340
If you are a pursuer

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:11.550
Sitting still will feel unnervingly passive.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.430
If you are a withdrawal

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.030
Staying present will feel uncomfortably exposed.

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:33.480
Both discomforts are simply the old pattern resisting change.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:37.990
Let your thoughts pass like traffic without jumping into the stream.

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:51.460
Third

phase-release
00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.270
We release your half of the reactive pattern

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.170
Recognise the two distinct dynamics.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:10.860
There is the real relational gap

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:13.390
And there is the tactical maneuvering.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.580
Pursuing harder.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.550
Because they pulled back

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:41.760
Or retreating further because they pressed forward.

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:45.880
Each move is a logical attempt to find safety.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:49.540
But together they lock you into the precise distance

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.210
You both dread.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.900
You cannot put down their half of the pattern

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.960
But you can choose to stop your half of the dance.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:22.850
Offer a quiet word of gratitude

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.630
To your conscious mind and your heart.

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:27.990
Or revealing the true driver

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.410
Behind this reflexive reaction

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:44.230
The deep seed of anxiety.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:47.090
That your safety and selfhood

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.390
Where on the verge of being compromised was real.

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:53.530
And that panic has been operating in the background

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:57.100
Consuming enormous amounts of your natural resilience

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.970
Thank you, your internal navigation system.

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.710
For sounding the alarm to protect you.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:20.680
And generally we assure it

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.330
That you can step back from the alarm now

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:36.910
Breathe into those core vulnerabilities.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:38.680
Of being left behind.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:39.860
Or swallow them

phase-rise
00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:54.570
We rise into centered relational strength

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.800
Visualize yourself from across the room.

00:06:58.340 --> 00:07:01.630
Caught in a dance that requires two people to maintain.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:16.770
Now picture the version of yourself who breaks the cycle

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:28.910
If you pursue

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.780
Offering one calm sentence

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:43.350
And stepping back.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:55.280
If you would draw

00:07:55.620 --> 00:08:00.900
Staying in the room for two minutes longer to say, "I am overwhelmed, but I am
not leaving."

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.490
Step into that centered mature presence

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.160
Choose the single step

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.430
You will take

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:23.430
On your side of the street, next time the pattern activates.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:39.500
Take one final slow breath in for six

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:41.740
And exhale for six

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.780
Feel the salad earth

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:56.640
Supporting your posture.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.240
Gently move your limbs

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.030
Open your eyes

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.990
And return to this meditation

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:18.390
To anchor your relational freedom
